   516  /**
   517   * isResClassIII takes a hexagon ID and determines if it is in a
   518   * Class III resolution (rotated versus the icosahedron and subject
   519   * to shape distortion adding extra points on icosahedron edges, making
   520   * them not true hexagons).
   521   * @param h The H3Index to check.
